1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,080
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,940
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,320
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:28,040
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,520
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:35,080
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:39,800
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:44,120
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,960
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:58,040
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:02,120
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:09,040
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,680
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,875 --> 00:01:18,625
=Episode 9=

17
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:23,239
Boss Hui.

18
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:28,600
(Shipping Route Transfer Agreement)

19
00:01:29,928 --> 00:01:33,201
(Party A: Qin Hai
Party B: Zhang Yongsheng)

20
00:01:36,599 --> 00:01:37,599
Who is it?

21
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,840
Why did Gui Sheng kill Hutou Jun too?

22
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:41,920
Boss Liu.

23
00:01:43,079 --> 00:01:45,000
How do you know the person
who killed Hutou Jun

24
00:01:45,239 --> 00:01:46,359
was from the Nanhu Gang?

25
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:47,959
Do you know something?

26
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:49,200
How did you know?

27
00:01:53,319 --> 00:01:55,359
Since Hai's death has yet to be avenged,

28
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,959
the election for the shot-caller

29
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,920
will be put on hold.

30
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:01,120
As for Nanhu Gang's territories,

31
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:04,319
we'll divide them equally
among the brothers.

32
00:02:05,719 --> 00:02:06,319
Boss Yong.

33
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,400
Gui Sheng wasn't the killer,

34
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,719
but Tai

35
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,919
avenged Boss Hai.

36
00:02:13,479 --> 00:02:16,240
Wouldn't splitting it equally
be a little unfair?

37
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,159
Fei Liu.

38
00:02:17,719 --> 00:02:19,080
Boss Tai already said it himself.

39
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,960
Boss Hui found the person
who killed Boss Hai.

40
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,080
That's a great contribution.

41
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,960
How is splitting it equally unfair?

42
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:24,960
Exactly.

43
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:26,080
Boss Liu.

44
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:28,439
We're all working for the organization.

45
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,639
There's no need to fight over this.

46
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,599
Hui.

47
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:35,639
You've contributed the most recently.

48
00:02:36,039 --> 00:02:37,479
You can go back and properly

49
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:39,400
take care of your own business now.

50
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:42,960
As for Boss Hai's matter,

51
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:44,800
leave it to Tai.

52
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,199
I'll follow your arrangement.

53
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:51,439
Boss Yong.

54
00:02:52,479 --> 00:02:53,319
We'll leave first.

55
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:59,400
(Loyalty Hall
Honor and Justice)

56
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,680
If you've got the guts, don't look back!

57
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:05,719
Boss Hui.

58
00:03:06,479 --> 00:03:07,439
About Zhong...

59
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:07,759
Boss Hui.

60
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:08,439
It was me...

61
00:03:09,159 --> 00:03:09,919
I didn't handle Zhong's matter

62
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,479
properly.

63
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:13,680
I let him go because I couldn't
bring myself to do it.

64
00:03:14,759 --> 00:03:15,560
Whether you hit me or punish me,

65
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,599
I won't say a word.

66
00:03:16,822 --> 00:03:21,533
(Loyalty)

67
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,080
Whether you say Zhong betrayed me,

68
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,919
or that he lacked courage,

69
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:28,800
he followed me for six years.

70
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,039
Do you realize that by showing
mercy today,

71
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:34,280
you could have caused
serious consequences?

72
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,240
Boss Hui.

73
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:36,479
I'm sorry.

74
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,560
The thing you should
be most grateful for

75
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,120
is that you still have the chance

76
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,400
to apologize to me.

77
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,879
But being ruthless once

78
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,039
is better than explaining yourself
ten times

79
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,800
and begging someone to forgive you.

80
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:55,080
Do you understand?

81
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,479
Yes, Boss Hui.

82
00:03:58,479 --> 00:03:59,080
Get up.

83
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:00,520
Thank you, Boss Hui.

84
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,439
Thank you, Boss Hui.

85
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:04,000
This time,

86
00:04:04,479 --> 00:04:05,560
consider it making amends through merit.

87
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,280
Keep a close eye on the operations.

88
00:04:07,639 --> 00:04:08,520
Dongshan Tai

89
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,759
didn't get what he wanted.

90
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,080
He won't back down easily.

91
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,000
Don't use force again.

92
00:04:16,279 --> 00:04:17,480
Don't pick fights unnecessarily.

93
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:18,680
Understood?

94
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,079
Understood.

95
00:04:27,588 --> 00:04:30,007
(Loyalty)

96
00:04:44,079 --> 00:04:45,040
Come on!

97
00:05:09,839 --> 00:05:11,240
Don't you have something

98
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:13,000
you want to tell me?

99
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,680
Before you joined us...

100
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:28,560
Forget it.

101
00:05:31,839 --> 00:05:32,920
You had your reasons.

102
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:34,759
You're my brother.

103
00:05:36,519 --> 00:05:37,120
I trust you.

104
00:05:56,347 --> 00:06:00,505
♪Sometimes, I don't even know who I am♪

105
00:06:03,256 --> 00:06:07,604
♪When the sun shines bright,
rain still falls from the sky♪

106
00:06:09,612 --> 00:06:12,173
♪I want to smile, but I can't
lift the corners of my mouth♪

107
00:06:12,173 --> 00:06:15,715
♪All I can do is watch you in silence♪

108
00:06:16,347 --> 00:06:20,774
♪I can't read what's in your eyes♪

109
00:06:23,161 --> 00:06:25,248
♪How much farther can we go, brother♪

110
00:06:25,486 --> 00:06:29,454
♪Turning back is never easy♪

111
00:06:30,039 --> 00:06:32,711
♪I stand where day meets night♪

112
00:06:32,711 --> 00:06:39,080
♪Left, right, straight ahead♪

113
00:06:40,585 --> 00:06:42,482
♪I am the shadow of the day♪

114
00:06:42,482 --> 00:06:45,517
♪You are the shooting star of the night♪

115
00:06:47,130 --> 00:06:49,264
♪Just a brother♪

116
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,879
Lin.

117
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:57,120
If you had never met me...

118
00:06:58,519 --> 00:06:59,199
If...

119
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,720
If you hadn't joined Dongcheng Gang,

120
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,439
where would you have gone?

121
00:07:07,439 --> 00:07:08,000
I don't know.

122
00:07:10,079 --> 00:07:11,639
I never think about

123
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,480
things that never happened.

124
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,560
The life I'm living now

125
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:20,959
is the life I want.

126
00:07:22,839 --> 00:07:23,199
What about you?

127
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:45,040
I want to go back.

128
00:07:47,959 --> 00:07:49,680
I want to go back.

129
00:08:16,839 --> 00:08:17,600
You are here.

130
00:08:28,300 --> 00:08:29,680
(Shipping Route Transfer Agreement)

131
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:32,799
Looks like the investigation
into Qin Hai

132
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:35,519
has indeed uncovered
a lot of Dongcheng Gang's

133
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:36,639
illegal businesses.

134
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:41,080
All the evidence of Dongcheng
Gang's crimes

135
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:42,600
is here.

136
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:45,200
Does this mean my mission is complete?

137
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:45,679
Can I...

138
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:47,480
You did an excellent job
on your mission.

139
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:48,799
But...

140
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,519
these pieces of evidence alone

141
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:53,559
are not enough to bring
down Dongcheng Gang.

142
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:54,720
What's more,

143
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,120
Dongcheng Gang has just
absorbed Nanhu Gang.

144
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:58,440
Officer Luo,

145
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,720
I've been undercover in Dongcheng
Gang for five years.

146
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,720
This is all the evidence I've been able
to find.

147
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,919
If even this isn't enough
to convict them,

148
00:09:04,919 --> 00:09:05,440
I don't understand

149
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,759
what the point of staying here is.

150
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:07,960
Maybe in another two years,

151
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,320
I could even run for shot-caller.

152
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,399
Lin Che.

153
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:11,759
Remember this.

154
00:09:11,879 --> 00:09:12,840
You're a police officer.

155
00:09:13,039 --> 00:09:15,080
I spend every day doing illegal things.

156
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,879
I smash people's heads with bottles.

157
00:09:16,879 --> 00:09:18,320
I watch people get stabbed to death
right in front of me.

158
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:20,039
And I can't do anything.

159
00:09:20,039 --> 00:09:21,360
Am I still a police officer?

160
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,279
You need to understand.

161
00:09:24,159 --> 00:09:25,799
Before the shot-caller election,

162
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:27,759
Dongcheng Gang will be
at its most unstable.

163
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:29,720
It's also when large-scale

164
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,159
violent incidents are most likely
to happen.

165
00:09:31,559 --> 00:09:33,279
It's precisely
because you're a police officer,

166
00:09:33,759 --> 00:09:36,080
you need to stay inside Dongcheng Gang.

167
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,919
Keep watching their every move.

168
00:09:37,919 --> 00:09:39,039
Do you understand?

169
00:09:49,679 --> 00:09:51,519
After the shot-caller election is over,

170
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:53,840
your mission will be complete.

171
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:56,559
I'll arrange for you to come back
as soon as possible.

172
00:10:02,735 --> 00:10:06,118
(POLICE HEADQUARTERS)

173
00:10:08,399 --> 00:10:09,440
Come, have some tea.

174
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,519
Deputy Commissioner,
what brings you here?

175
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,399
Why can't I come?

176
00:10:14,559 --> 00:10:16,159
The Dongcheng and Nanhu gangs

177
00:10:16,399 --> 00:10:18,000
used to keep each other in check.

178
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,600
All we had to do was watch them

179
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,799
fight among themselves.

180
00:10:22,159 --> 00:10:22,840
But what about now?

181
00:10:23,399 --> 00:10:25,799
Now Dongcheng Gang has become
the dominant force.

182
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:27,600
How are we supposed to control this?

183
00:10:28,919 --> 00:10:30,519
What exactly are you doing?

184
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:31,480
Sorry, Sir.

185
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,799
Can I get rid of the word

186
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,399
"Deputy" in my title?

187
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,039
Do you want to get promoted?

188
00:10:39,279 --> 00:10:41,200
Who killed Qin Hai doesn't matter.

189
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:42,879
What the media cares about is

190
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,480
whether the killer
has been brought to justice.

191
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,480
Do you know

192
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,120
how to write "stability"?

193
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,440
Yes, Sir.

194
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,240
Why are you throwing a tantrum?

195
00:11:11,679 --> 00:11:12,799
These darn characters...

196
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,480
They know me, but I don't know them.

197
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:16,919
You're so uneducated.

198
00:11:17,159 --> 00:11:18,039
How can you run the territory?

199
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,240
Run the territory?

200
00:11:19,759 --> 00:11:21,000
You rely on this.

201
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,240
Iron head?

202
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,080
You talk too much.

203
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:25,919
Just read it.

204
00:11:27,954 --> 00:11:29,840
(Basic Information on Shawang Street
Boutique Arcades)

205
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,440
Boss Hui's new businesses

206
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,639
are mostly located downtown.

207
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,360
Three arcades,

208
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:37,559
one roller rink, and one
entertainment center.

209
00:11:38,279 --> 00:11:39,720
When they were under
Nanhu Gang's control,

210
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,240
they were all quite profitable.

211
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:45,919
The arcades could work.

212
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,279
Following Hutou Jun's methods,

213
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,919
we could bring in some
gambling machines.

214
00:11:51,559 --> 00:11:52,759
The roller rink...

215
00:11:54,559 --> 00:11:56,960
Nanhu Gang used it to distribute drugs
when they ran it.

216
00:11:58,559 --> 00:11:59,679
Maybe we could do the same...

217
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:00,200
Lin.

218
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:04,919
Once we take over,
we'll run it differently.

219
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:06,919
We don't deal drugs.

220
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,360
Fine, we won't.

221
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,759
Why are you taking it so seriously?

222
00:12:13,559 --> 00:12:15,279
Just a reminder, Boss Hui doesn't
like that either.

223
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:20,840
(Roller Rink Personnel Records)
Hey.

224
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:22,240
Where

225
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:24,320
was it that Tidao learned to fight?

226
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:25,639
At a boxing gym.

227
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:27,320
Boss Lin.

228
00:12:27,519 --> 00:12:28,879
You don't need Tidao to teach you
how to fight.

229
00:12:29,159 --> 00:12:29,720
I can teach you.

230
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,279
Fifty bucks an hour.

231
00:12:33,080 --> 00:12:33,480
Deal?

232
00:12:37,279 --> 00:12:39,559
What if we turn the roller rink
into a cage-fighting venue?

233
00:12:39,559 --> 00:12:40,360
What do you think?

234
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,000
We could sell drinks.

235
00:12:42,879 --> 00:12:43,720
There's good money in that.

236
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,879
That little profit from drinks
won't get us anywhere.

237
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:48,480
We get a few fighters

238
00:12:48,759 --> 00:12:49,639
for underground fights.

239
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:51,399
The customers place bets,

240
00:12:51,919 --> 00:12:52,600
and we take a cut.

241
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:53,519
Guaranteed profit.

242
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,639
You fight first.

243
00:12:55,279 --> 00:12:56,080
What about the entertainment club?

244
00:12:57,039 --> 00:12:58,000
We keep it running as is.

245
00:12:59,159 --> 00:12:59,799
But...

246
00:13:00,799 --> 00:13:02,240
we'll replace the staff
with our own people.

247
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,120
Boss Lin.

248
00:13:03,559 --> 00:13:05,240
We've never run an entertainment
club before.

249
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,279
Where are we gonna find
the right person?

250
00:13:07,279 --> 00:13:08,159
What a pain.

251
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:12,399
Actually, I know just the person.

252
00:13:18,639 --> 00:13:20,279
This much. Not a cent less.

253
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,960
You've got quite an appetite.

254
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,960
I don't really care if I take the job.

255
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:25,679
I'm pretty comfortable where I am.

256
00:13:25,679 --> 00:13:27,320
I've got a whole crew of girls under me,

257
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,279
and I don't have to dance
for customers anymore.

258
00:13:30,559 --> 00:13:31,480
Fine.

259
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:36,480
And on top of that, I want

260
00:13:36,879 --> 00:13:37,840
a twenty-percent cut.

261
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:41,279
Come on! You're already asking
for that much,

262
00:13:41,279 --> 00:13:42,159
and you still want twenty percent?

263
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,360
How much more do you want?

264
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,519
Thanks, boss.

265
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,200
Lin.

266
00:13:48,559 --> 00:13:49,120
What's wrong?

267
00:13:52,879 --> 00:13:54,360
The cops seized the gambling machines.

268
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,879
Boss Hui's shipment got hit too.

269
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,360
What do we do?

270
00:14:03,159 --> 00:14:03,879
Let's go.

271
00:14:05,919 --> 00:14:06,480
We're heading out.

272
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:15,200
Boss Hui.

273
00:14:15,519 --> 00:14:16,360
We checked.

274
00:14:16,879 --> 00:14:17,639
Dongshan Tai's,

275
00:14:17,799 --> 00:14:19,559
Fei Liu's, Boss Ji's,
and the other elders' goods

276
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,519
were seized too.

277
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:23,080
(Dongcheng Tiger)
They seized goods from the new turf.

278
00:14:26,519 --> 00:14:27,679
The cops are just sending us a warning.

279
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:28,799
Once things cool down,

280
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:30,000
we go back to business as usual.

281
00:14:31,919 --> 00:14:33,320
The investigation into Boss Hai

282
00:14:33,559 --> 00:14:34,799
is in Dongshan Tai's hands now.

283
00:14:35,399 --> 00:14:36,840
What happened with Zhong
was a misunderstanding,

284
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:38,840
but the elders still have their doubts.

285
00:14:39,559 --> 00:14:41,279
We can't just sit back and do nothing.

286
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:42,919
Easy.

287
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:45,279
We show those elders

288
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:47,480
that we're the ones who can make money
for the gang.

289
00:14:48,759 --> 00:14:49,480
Got a plan?

290
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:50,759
Nope.

291
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:56,039
But there's always a way.

292
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:58,559
Your words.

293
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,200
You learn fast.

294
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:03,759
I'm smart.

295
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,000
Boss.

296
00:15:14,759 --> 00:15:16,000
Boss Liu's shipment got hijacked,

297
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,879
and he's making a huge fuss.

298
00:15:17,559 --> 00:15:18,480
He's demanding to see you.

299
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,159
Boss Liu...

300
00:15:20,679 --> 00:15:21,879
You know what he's like.

301
00:15:23,039 --> 00:15:24,519
He blows everything out of proportion

302
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:27,440
and likes to make a big show of it.

303
00:15:27,759 --> 00:15:30,000
As long as Mai Gao's shipment is safe,

304
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:32,399
this won't turn into anything serious.

305
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:34,519
By the way,

306
00:15:35,799 --> 00:15:37,399
what about the thing I asked you
to look into?

307
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,679
We searched everywhere in Shicheng.

308
00:15:40,639 --> 00:15:42,759
The dog farms, the mountains,
everywhere.

309
00:15:44,639 --> 00:15:45,600
But we found nothing.

310
00:15:45,879 --> 00:15:47,440
Nothing at all?

311
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:52,200
Maybe finding nothing works
in our favor.

312
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:54,039
Bao Zun.

313
00:15:56,159 --> 00:15:57,279
I need you to do something for me.
